ación y confianza distribuida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-73/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms",{"_69":252},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_44":254,"_51":62,"_46":255,"_56":256,"_65":-7,"_12":257,"_67":258},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-73/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_69":259},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_44":261,"_51":62,"_46":262,"_56":263,"_65":-7,"_12":264,"_67":265},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-73/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_69":266},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_44":268,"_51":62,"_46":269,"_56":270,"_65":-7,"_12":271,"_67":272},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-73/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_69":273},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_44":275,"_51":62,"_46":276,"_56":277,"_65":-7,"_12":278,"_67":279},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-73/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_69":280},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_44":282,"_51":62,"_46":283,"_56":284,"_65":-7,"_12":285,"_67":286},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-73/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_69":287},"platform